WEBVTT

00:00:56.172 --> 00:00:58.172
See you in the next video!

00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:31.312
and ciao.

00:01:31.628 --> 00:01:33.588
Groundhog says a terrible blizzard's coming.

00:01:34.316 --> 00:01:35.156
All right, go on.

00:01:35.244 --> 00:01:36.664
I don't know his shadow from a hole in the ground.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.800
You'll freeze to death if you stay here.

00:01:40.236 --> 00:01:42.116
And you won't have any food either.

00:01:42.376 --> 00:01:43.196
Don't worry about me.

00:01:43.564 --> 00:01:46.564
We got plenty of food, and right now, I'm going swimming.

00:01:46.668 --> 00:01:47.328
Ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:33.340
Yeah!

00:03:34.956 --> 00:03:35.456
Yeah!

00:03:45.996 --> 00:03:49.616
I'm that hungry little kitty cat you just read about.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.460
I'm so hungry I could eat, uh.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.360
Uh, Woodpecker?

00:03:56.492 --> 00:03:57.612
Yeah, that's it.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:18.080
What are you gonna have for dinner?

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.400
I'm gonna have catfish.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.230
Yeah?

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:23.880
Let me take your scuff.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:34.630
Do you know? I think that pigeon tried to choke me.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.390
You must be pretty cold, buddy.

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:38.760
Nah, I ain't cold.

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.280
Oh, yes you are. Step over by the fire and get warm for dinner.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:46.210
Let's see.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:38.640
Now, my fine pigeon, I'm going to pick you dry.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:21.780
Ice, meat, pretty good, but you know I'm still hungry.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.420
Yeah? So am I.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:30.390
Thank you.
